{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_9_level_main_09-05_beg",
  "groupId": "main_9",
  "stageId": "main_09-05",
  "title": "深池",
  "storyCode": "9-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "23f8c490673115139e44165c4dee5dd26d2581e69bcbda608a9f507ffa07bcff",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "上校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "我們又見面了，斯卡曼德羅斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "您似乎一點都不意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "意外？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "不，從見到你的第一面起，我就一點都不意外——你註定了會和這群渣滓廝混到一起，就因為你那從貴族禮儀課裡學來的廉價同情心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "......你跟蹤了我們？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "我更願意把這稱為合理管控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "無論如何，我還是要感謝你們。要不是有你們帶路，我還找不到這麼好的機會把這些蛀蟲一網打盡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "你們平時藏得還挺深的，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "我倒是挺好奇，是什麼讓你們膽大到就這麼聚在一起，莫非先前幾次微不足道的偷襲成果，讓你們誤以為小丘郡已經在你們的掌控下了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "野心勃勃的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "text": "咳，咳咳......上校先生，我想這其中一定有什麼誤會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "波頓男爵，你說錯了，我們之間一點誤會都沒有。我對你們私底下的勾當一清二楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "野心勃勃的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "text": "今天在這裡聚會的只是我的一些親朋，我可以拿我自己的名譽擔保——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "請閉嘴吧，爵士閣下。你們從祖輩那裡繼承而來的榮譽在我眼中一文不值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附庸風雅的女貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "text": "你、你竟敢這麼說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "辱沒你們這些所謂的貴族名聲的可不是我。是誰享受著維多利亞給予的地位與財富，又在暗地裡與最下流的反叛者勾結？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附庸風雅的女貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "text": "這都是徹頭徹尾的汙衊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "我開始對這些廢話感到厭倦了。渣滓就該和外面的渣滓一樣，一邊在火光裡痛哭流涕一邊為自己犯過的錯懺悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就像他說的那樣，窗外傳來陣陣哭喊聲，玻璃上映出星星點點的火光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "（隊長，你看外面！不光這裡，他把塔拉人的街區整個包圍了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "（他一點都沒有誇張，他在武力威懾普通居民。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "（我去過那街道，他們中的很大一部分都是老人和孩子！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "（手段突然這麼激進，看來他還掌握了別的資訊。他很可能對我們隱瞞了鬼魂部隊的情報。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "（三角鐵沒有消息嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "（從下午起，一直沒有通訊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "（糟了，他們會不會出事？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "（擔心也沒有意義。眼前更要緊的是，我們應該儘量阻止駐軍。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "（至少不能困在這裡......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "那個瓦伊凡，你可別想著破牆出去。在我問出結果之前，這間屋子裡一個人都不能走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "......唉，被發現了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "出來！我看到你了，不許動，給我老老實實跪在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "你家裡還有人嗎？快說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "沒、沒有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "真的沒藏人？我去看一眼。聽著，只要我看到你動一下，不管你是想幹什麼，我都會立馬把你腦袋射個對穿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "嗚嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "你在做什麼啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "誰啊，突然冒出來，還往我的弩跟前撞？小心你的腦袋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "咦，等一下，我認識你。你是亞當斯隊裡那個儀仗兵，對吧？我在新年活動上見過你。你們小隊沒收到行動命令吧，你在這裡幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我、我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我在附近有別的任務要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "那行，各做各的。你可別來妨礙我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "（那個叫風笛的姑娘說，我也能站出來，去改變局面。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "（我可以嗎......？至少，我該試試......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "他們......做錯了什麼，要被這麼粗暴地對待？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "你問我？你怎麼不問問他們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "哭什麼？窩藏暴徒，給他們送吃送喝，幫他們通風報信的不是你們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "你有證據嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "證據？你問我要什麼證據？九隊和十三隊的人還沒冷掉的屍體上的傷口算不算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "他們有的人死於恐怖的源石技藝，有的死於和我們手裡拿著的一模一樣的制式弓弩和長刀，還有的脖子上留著農用器械留下的痕跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "你想過我們的腦袋像麥子一樣被割麥機切下來、身體被拖拉機碾得像剛犁過的地一樣又薄又平......的慘狀嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "呃唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "想吐就對了。我親眼看到了，我還認識那顆腦袋之前的主人，我吐了整整一個下午。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "他們......為什麼要這樣對待同胞......這太殘忍了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "哈，你說對了，他們從來不配做人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "現在你明白這群人活該了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "還愣著幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "所以......這群人都是壞人嗎？就因為......他們都是塔拉人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "嗚......啊......我什麼都沒做過，長官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......她在哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "她的丈夫已經因礦石病去世，她的孩子還只有十來歲......這樣孤苦無依的人，真的會是兇手嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "我怎麼就跟你說不明白！他們都是一類人，你懂嗎？即便這個女人和她的小孩還沒有犯錯，他們都是一起的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "如果在你們面前的，不是塔拉人，而是其他維多利亞公民......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "你還會堅持把他們都視作暴徒嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "如果......我是說如果，打從一開始，就沒有那些歧視性的法案，塔拉人能和其他人賺到一樣多的鑄幣，獲得一樣的醫療機會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "是不是，接下來的衝突都不會發生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "行吧，儀仗兵，你愛問問題你就問。不會有答案的，誰都沒法告訴你答案。反正這家搜得差不多了，我該去下一戶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "嘿！我說我要走了，可沒說你能站起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "嗚......啊......別抓我，克雷格不能沒有我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "哭哭啼啼的煩死人了！一天到晚念叨著孩子，不就是想讓我心軟嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......你就放過她吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "哎，你呀，算了，看在我很忙的份上，我可以不管這個女人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "只不過，現在你這麼好心護著他們，小心回頭他們就眼睛都不眨地轟一下把你炸上天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "畢竟你別忘了，你和他們不是一類人。你看過他們的眼神了嗎？在他們眼裡，無論你怎麼表現，你始終都是我們的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......快走吧，求你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "嘖，別怪我沒提醒過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "呼......你沒事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "（搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "幸好，我和西爾莎說過話以後，總覺得心裡打鼓，忍不住繞回來看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "原來站出來......真的能起到一點點作用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "來，我扶你回房間去吧，今天晚上......不，明天也請別出門了。外面有暴徒，還有......呃，總之，這幾天小丘郡變得不太安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "對了，你的孩子呢？......克雷格？他不在家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "克雷格......他......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "他是不是被士兵抓走了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "我......我不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我得去找找他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "希爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_248",
      "text": "上校，我們剛才在外面的走廊裡抓住了這個人，當時他正在試圖從窗戶裡翻出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "對不起，對不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "讓我猜猜，這傢伙是你們之中哪一位的隨從，又準備向誰通風報信呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "野心勃勃的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "text": "我......（擦拭冷汗）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貪婪的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "text": "我要找律師！我也認識市長和好幾個議員......你們放開，你們沒有權力就這麼困住我們......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "看來我猜得沒錯，你們每個人都有份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "誰開口都行，我只需要知道你們的同夥到底在哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "這樣吧，我數到三——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "啊啊啊！不、不要殺我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附庸風雅的女貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "text": "我的天呐......為什麼要讓我看見如此殘酷的畫面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "你不能這樣做！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "是嗎？斯卡曼德羅斯，告訴你的下屬，我有沒有資格這麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "隊長......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "......臨時管制法。在我們無法得到倫蒂尼姆的直接命令時，漢密爾頓上校作為小丘郡駐軍的最高指揮官，的確擁有啟動全城戒嚴的權力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "我知道！可他真要這麼做的話，就等同於向那支暗處的部隊正式宣戰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "他們說的恐怕有一點是對的。我們已經身在一場戰爭中了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "但我們對那支部隊的瞭解比一無所知好不了多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "敵暗我明，不管怎樣，我都不覺得現在是率先開炮的好時機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "時機！他們在對我們發動單方面襲擊的時候，從來不會挑選時機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "上校，即便你不會接受任何我們小隊的建議，我也必須對你現在正要採取的行動表示明確的反對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "多謝你還有那麼點自知之明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "實話說，我也不喜歡這麼做。但凡他們給我留了別的選擇，我都不願意破壞帝國的法律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "可是沒有時間了。暗處的敵人正在步步緊逼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "這不也是你說的嗎，斯卡曼德羅斯？你們也是為了把鬼魂揪到日光下而來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "如果我們不抓緊這機會，把剩下的陰謀都逼出來，等不到明天，我們就會失去小丘郡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "上校，我相信越是危急關頭，我們選的每一步都越可能會導向不同的結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "我確定，在場的人裡有很多無辜者，您可以將他們先帶走，然後......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "不，我沒法浪費時間在沒意義的審訊上了。現在，就在這裡，這群渣滓必須交代清楚，他們的人手到底藏在哪裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "希爾，動手吧！我們耽擱得夠久了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩人威廉姆斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_239",
      "text": "......上校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "你又*維多利亞粗口*是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩人威廉姆斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_239",
      "text": "請把我抓走吧。我是波頓男爵的客人，我比這位可憐的幾乎失去意識的年輕人要知道得更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "野心勃勃的男爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "text": "西莫！你又何必站出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "西莫......西莫·威廉姆斯。你是那個詩人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩人威廉姆斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_239",
      "text": "是的，上校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "很好。我本來也想去找你，以免你繼續喋喋不休地煽動那些蠢貨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "威廉姆斯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩人威廉姆斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_239",
      "text": "不必擔心，女士。我該感謝上校，就在剛剛，我想到了我的詩該如何結尾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "抓起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "一顆......球？好眼熟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "漢密爾頓上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "text": "希爾！叫外面守著的人去把砸窗搗亂的渣滓找出......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "不，不對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "有聲音......從球裡傳出來的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "臥倒！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "什、什麼人？怎麼突然就冒了出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "啊——！是、是你們！快、快去報告上校，四隊撞見了暴徒，就在廣場西側的巷子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "這一支小隊，全殲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "領袖，附近的塔拉街區已經全部被我們佔領。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "你們是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "......是、是您？！您就是我們在等的......那個人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "您竟然向我伸出了手......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "......不會有人像剛才那樣壓迫你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "你也不再需要任何人的攙扶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "從今往後，你可以靠自己自由地行走在這片土地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "謝謝......謝謝您！我做的事，果然都是正確的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "我們塔拉人......終有一天能擁有自己的城市，我們能在街道上昂首挺胸，再也不會受到任何不公正的待遇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "是的，我們正是為了這一天而來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "領袖，快看啊，那、那是我們為您點燃的火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "宴會廳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "按照蔓德拉女士給的情報，現在駐軍高層都在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "不過，光是這種規模的爆炸，只能挫一下駐軍的氣焰，恐怕並不能消滅他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "除了駐軍，還有誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "一些向我們示好的當地人。他們知道了一些我們的底細，頭領們的意思是，為了大局，不能留活口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "他們還說，如果您不動手的話，他們會自己上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "......還是我的火......更快一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "通知他們，我知道該怎麼做——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "text": "我會拿下宴會廳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "text": "是的，領袖——您的火，必將打破這強壓著我們數百年的桎梏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
